            "Reviews alone will not carry a weak profile. Accurate categories, a real office address, consistent contact details, photos and a good website all work together. Our guide on [[a:blog/how-personal-injury-lawyers-rank-in-the-google-map-pack|how personal injury lawyers rank in the Google map pack]] explains the other pieces.",
